&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Trayectoria comprobada en producto, operaciones o roles técnicos similares en entornos de alto crecimiento (&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;108&quot;&gt;high-growth&lt;/em&gt;) o etapas iniciales (&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;141&quot;&gt;early-stage&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
