&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experiencia demostrable delimitando alcance (&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;45&quot;&gt;scoping&lt;/em&gt;) y/o entregando experiencias de producto de punta a punta (&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;112&quot;&gt;end-to-end&lt;/em&gt;), impulsando resultados clave de negocio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Inglés fluido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
